# L §7.3: "pow(x, n) with an integer n is exact" (3^2 = 9, 2^-1 = 1/2 = 0.5); "pow(0, q) with q < 0 is a division by
# zero (RUN-DIV)".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input two: int
input three: int
input zero: int
input minus_one: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  two = 2
  three = 3
  zero = 0
  minus_one = -1

ask q1: pow(three, two), pow(two, minus_one)
ask q2: pow(zero, minus_one)
=== expect
q1: (9, 0.5)
  cut 2026-12-31
q2: refused: RUN-DIV ...
  cut 2026-12-31
